  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SkyboxShader is a specialized class extending Shader, dedicated to rendering sky environments using cubemap textures. It manages complex atmospheric effects by loading configuration data for sun, moon, clouds, and stars into shader uniforms. The component orchestrates texture binding and uniform state transfer from associated CubemapMaterial instances into the WebGL2 rendering context."
  },
